## Layers (outside-in dependency rule)

```
Controller  →  UseCase (interface)  →  Domain Entity  →  Repository (interface)
                                               ↑
                                      Infrastructure (JPA adapter)
```

- `domain/` — Entities, repository interfaces (no framework dependencies)
- `application/` — Use case implementations (orchestrates domain objects)
- `infrastructure/` — JPA/MyBatis adapters, concrete repository classes
- `presentation/` — REST controllers, DTOs, request/response mapping

